WEBVTT

00:14.370 --> 00:19.430
Since they're Tengus,
I thought they'd look like this...

00:20.410 --> 00:22.710
But the name "Tengu"
means "Heaven" and "Dog,"

00:22.710 --> 00:26.510
implying they're a mixed-blood
race of angels and wolves.

00:27.010 --> 00:28.010
Report.

00:28.010 --> 00:30.550
To be precise, they're not mixed-blood.

00:30.550 --> 00:34.010
They're a race that spawns from angels
incarnated into the bodies of wolves.

00:34.380 --> 00:37.020
Yeah, a race of incarnated angels.

00:37.020 --> 00:37.930
Report.

00:37.930 --> 00:40.140
To be precise, they're not a "race,"

00:40.140 --> 00:41.900
but a case similar to
specimen Ranga,

00:41.900 --> 00:46.150
where an angel incarnates itself
into an individual that spawns packs.

00:46.510 --> 00:50.050
This girl in front of me is apparently
the daughter of the elder of the Tengus,

00:50.050 --> 00:52.530
worshipped as the god of the mountains.

00:52.530 --> 00:55.120
Nice to meet you,
Demon Lord Rimuru.

00:55.120 --> 00:59.040
My name is Momiji.
I have come here to represent our elder.

00:59.580 --> 01:01.540
It is a pleasure to be your acquaintance.

02:08.020 --> 02:12.240
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

02:39.510 --> 02:42.520
Shortly after we settled
our differences with Hinata,

02:42.520 --> 02:45.690
to earn the permission
for highway construction to Thalion,

02:45.690 --> 02:50.400
I sent Benimaru to the Tengu village
in the Kusha Mtns. as my envoy.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.070
EPISODE 64: BENIMARU'S ORDEAL

02:52.070 --> 02:53.530
This must be it.

02:57.440 --> 02:59.650
It appears they have
installed a barrier here.

03:00.490 --> 03:01.330
Halt!

03:04.160 --> 03:06.000
He's clearly trained in martial arts.

03:06.750 --> 03:09.710
Beyond this point is our hidden village.

03:09.710 --> 03:10.880
What brings you here?

03:11.270 --> 03:14.380
We came here from Tempest
on behalf of Demon Lord Rimuru.

03:16.720 --> 03:18.390
Two of you may pass.

03:32.480 --> 03:33.570
Wow.

03:36.370 --> 03:39.160
So the hidden village is
in another dimension...

03:39.160 --> 03:41.030
No wonder nobody could find it.

03:41.030 --> 03:41.990
This way.

03:47.010 --> 03:48.620
I can't let my guard down.

03:48.620 --> 03:52.960
Her strength could be on par
with Carrion, or even more.

03:53.750 --> 03:57.260
So, kind messengers.
What brings you to us?

03:57.260 --> 03:59.640
Do you wish to claim
possession of this land?

04:01.220 --> 04:03.220
We have no such intentions.

04:03.220 --> 04:06.390
All we want is permission
to pass Kusha Mtns.

04:06.770 --> 04:10.850
And if possible, we want permission to dig
a tunnel through this mountain as well.

04:10.850 --> 04:11.860
Hmph.

04:11.860 --> 04:15.030
So you're saying you have no ambition
to grab this land, then?

04:15.030 --> 04:17.399
You can pass the mountain all you want,

04:18.170 --> 04:19.910
but what is this "tunnel" you speak of?

04:19.910 --> 04:23.280
I don't know much myself,
but it involves digging a hole in the mountain

04:23.280 --> 04:25.660
to create a passage
through to the other side.

04:26.500 --> 04:27.620
Wait.

04:27.620 --> 04:29.330
Dig a hole through the mountains?

04:29.330 --> 04:30.750
Are you serious?

04:30.750 --> 04:33.380
Yes, that was the plan.

04:33.380 --> 04:36.300
But it is unrelated to
the route we have now.

04:36.300 --> 04:40.170
I only wanted to ask in case
it becomes necessary in the future.

04:40.170 --> 04:42.050
If you don't like it,
I won't force you.

04:42.430 --> 04:44.680
Digging a hole through
our sacred mountains?

04:44.680 --> 04:46.390
Will that be okay?

04:46.390 --> 04:48.270
Now you've done it.

04:48.270 --> 04:50.390
A slime can become
a Demon Lord all he wants,

04:50.390 --> 04:53.810
but I see no harm in it as long
as you guys don't interfere with us.

04:53.810 --> 04:58.570
I was even willing to turn a blind eye to
that smelly snake you've brought along.

04:59.150 --> 05:03.740
But I can't just let you mock
our beautiful mountains and abide.

05:04.050 --> 05:06.660
A smelly snake?
Are you talking about me?

05:06.970 --> 05:07.950
Hey, stop it...

05:12.460 --> 05:14.500
Such a silly technique.

05:14.500 --> 05:19.370
Mere status ailments won't work on me,
the daughter of the Tengu elder.

05:30.600 --> 05:32.270
Are you done?

05:32.270 --> 05:35.110
I suppose the Three Beastketeers
are all bark and no bite, huh?

05:35.540 --> 05:38.730
You better not rile me, country girl.

05:38.730 --> 05:41.490
I went easy on you because
we were here to negotiate,

05:41.490 --> 05:43.780
but perhaps I didn't need to?

05:43.780 --> 05:46.530
Went easy? That's my line.

05:46.530 --> 05:50.000
I had made quite an effort
to avoid killing an envoy like you.

05:50.500 --> 05:52.620
What a problem this has become.

06:03.550 --> 06:04.890
That is enough.

06:05.390 --> 06:08.300
I apologize for my words.

06:08.300 --> 06:10.640
But I can't have my companion be killed.

06:10.640 --> 06:14.150
S-Sir Benimaru,
you thought I would lose?!

06:14.150 --> 06:15.030
Yes.

06:15.030 --> 06:17.900
You would have been sliced
in half if I hadn't stopped you.

06:17.900 --> 06:20.690
N-Nonsense! I was holding back!

06:20.690 --> 06:23.740
No, you fail to properly
control your Aura.

06:23.740 --> 06:25.530
You put too much power into it.

06:25.530 --> 06:27.910
N-No way...!

06:27.910 --> 06:30.290
I... lost...?!

06:30.650 --> 06:32.370
You fool of a daughter!

06:33.000 --> 06:35.040
M-Mother?!

06:35.880 --> 06:38.170
My name is Kaede.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.300
It is a pleasure to meet you,
Sir Benimaru.

06:44.300 --> 06:48.390
Elder, you don't need to force yourself.
We're simply here to introduce ourselves...

06:49.970 --> 06:52.310
Don't mind it, young man.

06:52.310 --> 06:55.390
Anyway, that was quite some
swordplay you showed off.

06:55.830 --> 06:57.190
Haze style, is it?

06:57.190 --> 06:58.190
How did...

06:58.690 --> 07:01.030
Wait, I get it.

07:01.030 --> 07:05.400
Lady Momiji's dance resembles
my own sword style. Could it be...

07:05.880 --> 07:07.030
That's right.

07:07.030 --> 07:09.660
I've studied Haze as well.

07:09.660 --> 07:12.660
From my master, Araki Byakuya.

07:15.620 --> 07:17.920
A little over three hundred years ago,

07:18.350 --> 07:23.420
I stayed in the village of the Ogres
to sharpen my swordplay skills.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.530
My master, Byakuya, had a grandchild.

07:27.180 --> 07:29.430
He's my senior in the apprenticeship.

07:35.480 --> 07:39.440
A born talent,
a genius in the way of the sword.

07:45.190 --> 07:49.780
"It pains me so much
that I am unable to give him a name,"

07:49.780 --> 07:52.200
my master often said.

07:53.240 --> 07:56.080
However, Araki Byakuya is a human.

07:56.080 --> 08:00.790
If he were to name a monster,
he could lose his life.

08:01.460 --> 08:04.380
Eventually, Byakuya grew old
and passed away,

08:04.380 --> 08:08.470
leaving behind his grandchild who later
became known as a Sword Ogre, a savant.

08:09.050 --> 08:10.470
Savant...

08:13.110 --> 08:16.230
I was smitten by his sword techniques.

08:27.990 --> 08:32.240
Wait a minute.
Are you talking about Hakuro's...

08:32.240 --> 08:35.159
Oh, Hakuro?

08:35.159 --> 08:38.750
I see. So the savant
has been given a name.

08:39.500 --> 08:41.039
But more importantly...

08:42.169 --> 08:45.050
I'm surprised to hear he's still alive.

08:49.550 --> 08:51.550
W-Wait, wait!

08:51.550 --> 08:54.050
Does Hakuro know about this?!

08:56.680 --> 08:59.060
But now I can rest in relief.

08:59.810 --> 09:02.690
Because the fine young man
Sir Hakuro raised

09:02.690 --> 09:05.190
is going to be the future
groom of my daughter.

09:06.690 --> 09:08.280
W-Wait, Mother?!

09:08.690 --> 09:10.820
Now, Sir Benimaru.

09:10.820 --> 09:13.990
I will gladly accept all
of your earlier requests.

09:13.990 --> 09:18.330
On top of that, we're willing to swear
our allegiance to Demon Lord Rimuru.

09:18.830 --> 09:23.460
However, it is only if you accept
becoming my daughter's spouse.

09:24.340 --> 09:28.300
Wait! I understand that
you accept this man, Mother,

09:28.300 --> 09:30.720
but I haven't yet!

09:30.720 --> 09:31.680
Oh?

09:33.180 --> 09:36.600
It is true that he appears
to be stronger than I am,

09:36.600 --> 09:40.730
but I don't want you
to force him into this.

09:40.730 --> 09:43.370
I want to win his love first.

09:44.580 --> 09:47.530
"A good woman is one
who makes her man turn toward her,"

09:47.530 --> 09:49.490
isn't that what you always say?

09:57.870 --> 10:00.250
I apologize I couldn't give you
an answer immediately.

10:00.250 --> 10:03.620
I'll bring the earlier question
back home and think it over.

10:03.620 --> 10:06.790
Feel free to take your time on it.

10:06.790 --> 10:10.340
She's still fifteen, after all.

10:10.340 --> 10:13.090
For now, I wish to form
a favorable relationship

10:13.090 --> 10:16.140
between Demon Lord Rimuru
and the Tengu.

10:17.180 --> 10:21.390
It may not have been obvious,
but I don't have much time left.

10:26.400 --> 10:29.790
I hadn't expected Lady Kaede
to be suffering from a severe illness.

10:29.790 --> 10:32.150
She does not appear to be so at all.

10:32.150 --> 10:34.490
I believe it's not an illness.

10:35.550 --> 10:40.700
She used the majority of her power
to bring Momiji into the world.

10:40.700 --> 10:43.710
She gave birth to her fifteen years ago
and gave her a name.

10:43.710 --> 10:46.250
As a result, she lost almost
all the magicule she had

10:46.250 --> 10:49.040
when she was known as
the god of the mountains.

10:49.040 --> 10:50.710
I see.

10:53.800 --> 10:55.220
My dear...

10:55.720 --> 11:01.130
That young man is the final hope
you sent to me.

11:01.130 --> 11:05.980
I hope he'll serve as a reliable backer
for our inexperienced daughter.

11:05.980 --> 11:09.370
If he rejects the offer,
then it is what it is.

11:09.370 --> 11:13.490
You're there on Demon Lord
Rimuru's side, aren't you?

11:14.700 --> 11:17.990
I thought you'd die before I did.

11:18.870 --> 11:20.910
What a delightful miscalculation.

11:25.250 --> 11:30.750
And when you see her, will you be
reminded of our own past a little?

11:32.590 --> 11:34.720
And now back to the present.

11:35.300 --> 11:38.090
I am the new Demon Lord.
My name is Rimuru.

11:38.090 --> 11:40.190
I'm a pacifist in general,

11:40.190 --> 11:42.510
so if you have any problems,
just tell me about it.

11:42.510 --> 11:45.230
There is no need for such concern.

11:45.230 --> 11:47.940
We recognize you
as the ruler of this forest

11:47.940 --> 11:50.690
and look forward to being
a good neighbor to you.

11:50.690 --> 11:53.730
However, we will not allow you
to interfere in our affairs.

11:57.530 --> 12:00.160
Aaah! Wait! Don't do anything, seriously!

12:02.910 --> 12:06.000
Phew, looks like Shion finally
learned how to control herself.

12:06.000 --> 12:08.160
She's still a little creepy, though.

12:09.170 --> 12:10.000
Hm?

12:12.400 --> 12:15.590
I'm sure she's feeling nervous herself.

12:15.590 --> 12:19.010
An inexperienced ruler can't afford
to be looked down upon.

12:19.010 --> 12:21.970
I can understand that.

12:21.970 --> 12:25.060
All right.
I understand your demand.

12:25.060 --> 12:27.940
Just to make sure, you recognize
the rights of the High Orcs

12:27.940 --> 12:30.650
who have already moved
into the mountains, right?

12:30.650 --> 12:33.520
Yes. That is not a problem.

12:33.520 --> 12:36.740
We do not claim exclusive rights
over the mountains' blessings,

12:36.740 --> 12:39.700
and you're free to do whatever
you want with the ores.

12:39.700 --> 12:43.160
We wish to be left alone.
That is all.

12:43.160 --> 12:46.330
Then what is she being
so cautious about?

12:46.330 --> 12:50.670
We really don't have any intention
of starting a conflict with you, okay?

12:50.670 --> 12:52.670
You want us to believe that?

12:52.670 --> 12:53.750
Yeah.

12:53.750 --> 12:58.550
Or do have anything that makes you
suspect we're aiming to take your land?

12:59.170 --> 13:04.010
You associate with that crafty
bird woman Frey, don't you?

13:04.010 --> 13:07.390
That's the biggest proof that you
have the ambition to get our land.

13:07.390 --> 13:09.060
Time out!

13:09.060 --> 13:10.310
What does that mean?

13:10.310 --> 13:13.020
It means wait until after
we discuss some things first!

13:15.570 --> 13:17.230
Now, what do you guys think?

13:17.230 --> 13:22.200
Former Demon Lord Frey's domain
is connected to the Kusha Mtns.

13:22.200 --> 13:26.080
It is not hard to imagine there's
some conflict between the two sides.

13:26.080 --> 13:30.040
True. She might've tried
to invade at some point.

13:30.040 --> 13:32.500
But for what purpose?

13:32.500 --> 13:38.050
Lady Frey likes high places, so perhaps
that's why she wants the mountains?

13:38.050 --> 13:41.840
Oh, come on. There's no way
she'd attack just because of that.

13:41.840 --> 13:44.800
Besides, the hidden village
is in another dimension, right?

13:44.800 --> 13:45.680
Yes.

13:46.560 --> 13:50.060
Hey, stop ignoring me!

13:50.680 --> 13:55.060
Like I said, Demon Lord Frey was after
the Sorcerous Dynasty of Thalion!

13:55.060 --> 13:59.690
And as a step towards that,
she wants us to serve as her subordinate!

13:59.690 --> 14:02.950
Huh? Why does Ms. Frey want Thalion?

14:03.380 --> 14:07.660
It's because the capital of Thalion is
a highrise city on top of a large sacred tree.

14:07.660 --> 14:11.960
As the Sky Queen Frey,
she wants it no matter what.

14:12.420 --> 14:14.960
That means Geld was right?!

14:15.750 --> 14:19.380
To begin with, Demon Lord Frey,
Thalion, and the Tengu

14:19.380 --> 14:22.510
was in an awkward
three-way relationship.

14:23.050 --> 14:26.680
While all that was going on,
Clayman and I waged a war,

14:26.680 --> 14:28.350
and once the dust settled,

14:28.350 --> 14:32.100
Carrion and Frey now serve
Demon Lord Rimuru.

14:32.100 --> 14:34.390
It was the birth of a new superpower.

14:34.980 --> 14:38.400
Since the Tengu alone could not
fight back against such power,

14:38.400 --> 14:42.240
their government was in a heated debate
over how to hold themselves going forward.

14:42.240 --> 14:45.160
And then Benimaru
and his group came along.

14:45.740 --> 14:48.990
Having Albis, one of the Three Beastketeers
there was a bad move.

14:49.620 --> 14:54.580
Momiji must've taken it as my attempt
at silently pressuring her.

14:54.580 --> 14:57.250
How's Ms. Frey been doing lately?

14:57.250 --> 14:59.840
Well, as for Lady Frey,

14:59.840 --> 15:03.760
she seems to be tremendously satisfied
with your plans for the new capital.

15:03.760 --> 15:05.050
I see.

15:05.050 --> 15:09.430
Then she likely lost interest
in Thalion and the Tengu village.

15:09.430 --> 15:10.930
Yes, I believe so too.

15:10.930 --> 15:12.640
Well, there you have it.

15:12.640 --> 15:15.600
I hope that clears up
the misunderstanding.

15:16.350 --> 15:20.360
No way...
So I was overthinking it all along?

15:25.030 --> 15:29.370
With that misunderstanding behind us,
our talks quickly came to a close.

15:29.370 --> 15:34.120
We agreed to help each other out,
in case something ever happened.

15:34.120 --> 15:36.670
Well, I suppose that is all?

15:36.670 --> 15:37.870
Yes, my lord.

15:37.870 --> 15:40.790
Thank you, Demon Lord Rimuru,
for allowing us

15:40.790 --> 15:43.130
to conduct such constructive negotiations.

15:44.210 --> 15:45.800
And there's also this.

15:45.800 --> 15:50.800
We have a letter from our elder,
Lady Kaede, for you, my lord.

15:54.810 --> 16:02.110
"Dear Sir, I hope this letter finds you
in good health in this early spring season."

16:02.530 --> 16:05.150
"Now, that should be enough
as the preface.

16:05.150 --> 16:10.240
I, Kaede, have my heart soar after
hearing you're still alive and well."

16:10.240 --> 16:10.870
Hm?

16:12.330 --> 16:16.150
"I am regrettably too ill
to meet you in person,

16:16.150 --> 16:18.540
so I'm sending our daughter
to your side in my stead.

16:18.540 --> 16:22.210
I believe things are complicated,
and there have been a few misunderstandings,

16:22.210 --> 16:24.590
but I hope you will
treat our daughter well."

16:24.590 --> 16:28.590
Wait, are you sure that letter's for me?
It really doesn't sound that way!

16:28.590 --> 16:33.220
"Also, she was boasting about how she'll
make Sir Benimaru turn towards her,

16:33.220 --> 16:36.480
- so she doesn't seem to be against the idea..."
- W-Wait, Mother?!

16:36.820 --> 16:38.940
I knew it! They are two letters!

16:38.940 --> 16:41.980
Mother, why can't you be more careful?!

16:41.980 --> 16:43.020
Oh, I see.

16:43.020 --> 16:45.070
- My lady, please, calm down!
- So she put the message for Hakuro

16:45.070 --> 16:46.320
- Are you okay?!
- in the letter for me.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.110
- My lady...
- in the letter for me.

16:47.110 --> 16:48.400
My lady!

16:48.400 --> 16:50.990
Heh-heh, that's just like her.

16:52.490 --> 16:53.660
Hakuro?!

16:54.330 --> 16:58.250
I have just returned from Falmuth.

17:03.750 --> 17:06.000
Hmm, I see.

17:06.369 --> 17:11.839
"She has a great deal of strength
but is still lacking in technique."

17:11.839 --> 17:15.599
"As a fellow student of the sword,
and as her father as well,

17:15.599 --> 17:20.770
I hope that the savant Hakuro will deign
to offer her training and instruction."

17:21.520 --> 17:25.770
To my beloved husband,
from your ever-loving Kaede," huh.

17:26.319 --> 17:30.780
So she still likes me, eh?

17:30.780 --> 17:33.820
And to think I'd be seeing
my own daughter as well.

17:34.600 --> 17:37.540
Living all these years does bring
all kinds of delightful surprises.

17:38.160 --> 17:42.420
A-Are you my father?

17:42.420 --> 17:43.790
Yes, indeed.

17:44.420 --> 17:48.050
I am your father, Hakuro.

17:51.260 --> 17:55.050
F-Father!

17:55.470 --> 17:59.640
I must warn you Momiji,
your training won't be easy.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.060
Yes, Father!

18:01.060 --> 18:04.150
But I want to see you overcome that

18:04.150 --> 18:06.480
and win the heart of Young Master!

18:06.480 --> 18:07.230
Yes, Father!

18:08.570 --> 18:10.870
Hey, Hakuro! Wait a minute!

18:10.870 --> 18:13.030
I have things and positions
to uphold, you know!

18:13.030 --> 18:14.320
What do you mean?

18:14.320 --> 18:17.240
Do you have a problem with
my daughter, Young Master?

18:17.240 --> 18:19.200
That's not what I said!

18:19.200 --> 18:21.790
Besides, you didn't even know she existed!

18:21.790 --> 18:23.870
Why are you acting like her father now?!

18:23.870 --> 18:28.630
Now that I do,
I have a responsibility for her, do I not?

18:28.630 --> 18:30.460
What's up with this development?

18:30.460 --> 18:32.420
Oh, so that's why...

18:33.260 --> 18:36.470
Dear Brother, I have a message
for you from Lady Albis.

18:36.470 --> 18:38.310
Wh-What is it?

18:40.020 --> 18:43.770
"Sir Benimaru, I have made up my mind."

18:43.770 --> 18:45.690
"I intend to defeat Lady Momiji in battle"

18:45.690 --> 18:48.150
"and take the right
to be your wife for myself."

18:48.150 --> 18:52.400
"Even in the worst-case scenario,
I could always be your concubine, couldn't I?"

18:52.900 --> 18:56.240
"I won't give up on it,
so prepare yourself."

18:56.240 --> 18:58.490
Benimaru, are you okay?

18:59.990 --> 19:02.040
H-He's dead!

19:02.040 --> 19:06.040
To think even that Benimaru
has such an unexpected weakness.

19:06.040 --> 19:10.090
Still, man, it sure is hard
when you're popular with women, huh?

19:10.090 --> 19:13.130
Are you seriously saying that,
Great Rimuru?

19:13.130 --> 19:15.300
You have similar issues yourself,
don't you?

19:15.300 --> 19:16.150
Huh?

19:18.300 --> 19:20.970
I only have my eyes on you,
and you alone, Great Rimuru.

19:20.970 --> 19:23.100
I have no interest in silly romance.

19:23.100 --> 19:24.770
I wasn't asking, though.

19:24.770 --> 19:28.270
Still, Sir Benimaru is rather popular,
is he not?

19:28.270 --> 19:31.820
My sister's subordinates were also
after Sir Benimaru's heart,

19:31.820 --> 19:36.280
but I don't think they'd have much chance
against Lady Albis and Lady Momiji.

19:36.280 --> 19:38.070
Are you talking about Toka?

19:38.070 --> 19:41.620
And Saika as well, I believe?

19:41.620 --> 19:43.080
Yes, that's right.

19:43.080 --> 19:45.080
That said, those two were
after you at first

19:45.080 --> 19:47.750
but gave up because Soka already
had her eyes on you, Sir Soei.

19:47.750 --> 19:49.290
Don't be silly.

19:49.290 --> 19:51.130
No, it's true!

19:51.130 --> 19:52.880
- So it's a harem?!
- Yup.

19:53.590 --> 19:55.340
Now that he mentions it...

19:55.730 --> 19:58.640
Albis is a beautiful, reliable woman.

19:58.640 --> 20:02.350
While Momiji is a bit cheeky,
but a cute little-sister type.

20:02.350 --> 20:05.520
Numerous women including them
are aiming for Benimaru.

20:05.520 --> 20:07.350
What's up with that?!
Now I'm jealous!

20:07.350 --> 20:10.650
A harem! Yes, that would
make anyone jealous!

20:10.650 --> 20:12.430
Hmph, it's not all that great.

20:12.430 --> 20:14.940
Spite how he looks,
Benimaru is slow on stuff like this,

20:14.940 --> 20:17.180
and not particularly adept
in dealing with women.

20:17.180 --> 20:21.200
He acts tough, but I'm sure he is
more confused than he's letting on.

20:21.200 --> 20:23.160
For a man as manly as Sir Benimaru,

20:23.160 --> 20:26.080
it's only natural the women
around town would admire him.

20:26.080 --> 20:28.250
I have a lot to learn from him.

20:28.250 --> 20:30.830
Oh, no, you're doing
well enough, Sir Geld!

20:30.830 --> 20:34.090
Like I said before, Toka and the others
didn't even bat an eye on me.

20:34.090 --> 20:37.170
Sir Gabiru's back is so cool!

20:37.170 --> 20:38.050
Indeed!

20:38.050 --> 20:39.590
He is the man among men!

20:40.030 --> 20:42.600
We'll follow you wherever you go, Boss!

20:42.600 --> 20:45.020
Gabiru! Gabiru! Gabiru!

20:45.020 --> 20:48.350
For whatever reason,
people who cheer on me are all dudes.

20:48.350 --> 20:51.400
You just need to have
more encounters with women.

20:51.400 --> 20:53.400
I understand that a little.

20:53.400 --> 20:58.240
Well, there are a few female
dwarf apothecaries in my workplace.

20:58.240 --> 21:00.110
What is the problem, then?

21:00.110 --> 21:02.990
- What are these guys talking about?
- A big problem, actually.

21:02.990 --> 21:07.830
They told me that going out with a lizard
was "physically impossible."

21:07.830 --> 21:09.120
Oh...

21:09.120 --> 21:11.460
Species differences are
a big hurdle to overcome, yeah.

21:11.460 --> 21:14.920
And yet, it appeared like they
kept inviting Nanso and Hakuso

21:14.920 --> 21:18.720
out to eat or for dates
in the forests all the time!

21:18.720 --> 21:21.300
I find it so frustrating!

21:21.300 --> 21:23.300
The species differences be damned!

21:23.300 --> 21:25.850
I-I'm not sure what to say...

21:25.850 --> 21:29.020
Ridiculous.
You need to get up and do something.

21:29.020 --> 21:30.560
That's correct, Soei!

21:30.560 --> 21:32.690
Soei's right!

21:32.690 --> 21:36.610
Besides, women can be easier
to attract than one would expect.

21:36.610 --> 21:38.240
Th-They can?!

21:40.320 --> 21:42.820
Like that female knight
from the other day...

21:42.820 --> 21:44.660
What is it?! What did you do?!

21:44.660 --> 21:46.240
I'm interested!

21:46.240 --> 21:48.290
Tell us more!

21:48.290 --> 21:49.330
Ahem!

21:49.330 --> 21:49.870
Ah...

21:50.410 --> 21:52.870
Great Rimuru, that's enough joking.

21:52.870 --> 21:55.840
Don't we have my brother to talk about?

21:55.840 --> 21:56.630
Ah, yes.

21:57.300 --> 22:00.630
Benimaru, what do you think about this?

22:01.030 --> 22:03.010
Well...

22:03.010 --> 22:07.640
I believe it's still too early for me,
but I know one thing for sure...

22:07.640 --> 22:09.770
...one spouse is all I'd ever need.

22:10.770 --> 22:13.480
No harem, then.

22:13.480 --> 22:14.770
All right!

22:14.770 --> 22:19.690
I'll accept Lady Albis's challenge
and win the right to be your wife!

22:20.990 --> 22:22.150
Shuna...

22:22.530 --> 22:25.030
Great Rimuru, what do you say?

22:25.030 --> 22:26.420
Yeah, sure.

22:26.420 --> 22:28.830
I don't want any direct
duel-to-the-death or anything,

22:28.830 --> 22:32.290
but putting the effort to woo
the person you love is fine by me.

22:32.790 --> 22:35.830
Very well. Then it shall be it.

22:36.350 --> 22:37.430
Huh? What?

22:37.430 --> 22:39.510
I have a bad feeling about this...

22:42.300 --> 22:44.930
I won't lose to you, Lady Shuna.

22:44.930 --> 22:47.800
I'd love to see you try, Shion.

22:48.430 --> 22:50.770
I'm not really sure what's going on...

22:50.770 --> 22:52.230
...but I'll run for now!

22:53.640 --> 22:57.020
On this day, a strange new tradition
was born in the nation of monsters,

22:57.020 --> 23:00.940
where you show your might to win
the attention of the person you love...

23:00.940 --> 23:04.200
The start of a "Love on the battlefield."

24:36.000 --> 24:38.990
Next time,
"The Lightspeed Hero."
